cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and identify the exact commit used."
type: software
title: "Solar Sim NR"
authors:
  - name: "wangyufanshuai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wangyufanshuai/solar-sim-nr"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research-alpha numerical relativity sources and portable exact-coefficient
  checks for a first-order CCZ4 research kernel. The included diagnostic
  reproduction concerns a fixed-background continuum real-formula first
  variation and does not qualify black-hole evolution, discrete boundary
  stability or waveform accuracy.
keywords:
  - numerical relativity
  - CCZ4
  - reproducibility
  - exact arithmetic
